er":{"spec":"https://i.ytimg.com/sb/lBUr8DGSj-U/storyboard3_L$L/$N.jpg?sqp=-oaymwGhAUg48quKqQOYAYgBAZUBAAAEQpgBMqABPKgBBLIBQBANDBAVHyYtDg4PEhcrLCkPDhAVHyoyKQ8RFBgmPTgtERQeKjFLRzYVHCkuOUdNPyUuNz1HUlFFM0BCQ0xERkO6AUARERUjRENDQxETFi9DQ0NDFRYpQ0NDQ0MjL0NDQ0NDQ0RDQ0NDQ0JCQ0NDQ0NCQkJDQ0NDQkJCQkNDQ0JCQkJCovOX_wMGCPGaj9QG|48#27#100#10#10#0#default#rs$AOn4CLCFE5ZGnNdQu65GTYSFcfVnsUtazA|80#45#179#10#10#10000#M$M#rs$AOn4CLBdEFgzOuwKMe-4Wv1C74is2Hgehw|160#90#179#5#5#10000#M$M#rs$AOn4CLAOa4JeuhwBuADB0UuXj4KFsmdOag|320#180#179#3#3#10000#M$M#rs$AOn4CLCsLlCmTyHfLRR-_m9nBeRvj65ZHw","recommendedLevel":3,"fineScrubbingRecommendedLevel":2,"highResolutionRecommendedLevel":3}},"microformat":{"playerMicroformatRenderer":{"thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/lBUr8DGSj-U/maxresdefault.jpg","width":1280,"height":720}]},"embed":{"iframeUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/lBUr8DGSj-U","width":1280,"height":720},"title":{"simpleText":"I asked 100 FPL Experts for their Gameweek 1 teams, and this is what I found out... | FPL 2026/27"},"description":{"simpleText":"Win your league or your money back 👉 https://go.fantasyfootballhub.co.uk/landing/fplmate?utm_source=affiliate\u0026utm_medium=affiliates\u0026utm_campaign=FPLMate\u0026utm_content=youtube\u0026via=FPLMate #ad\n\nWelcome to THE BIG Fantasy Premier League video for GW1, 2026/27!\n\nI asked 100 FPL experts, podcasters, bloggers, writers and YouTubers to send me their gameweek 1 squad drafts. I recorded all of the data from all 100 teams, so I could work out a bunch of information that I could share with you. We have found out who the most popular players are, which formation is the most popular, who is most popular captain, and much more.\n\n0:00 Intro\n0:52 Goalkeepers\n3:59 Defenders\n8:05 Midfielders\n10:54 Forwards\n13:21 Top picks\n14:57 Formations\n15:52 Key decisions\n22:00 Overrated picks\n25:22 Underrated picks\n26:42 GW1 Captains\n\nIf you like what you see, subscribe and become my latest mate!\n\n📧 Business enquiries: dan@fplmate.co.uk\n\n🐦 https://www.twitter.com/FPLMate\n📸 https://www.instagram.com/FPLMate\n🎙️ Podcast: linktr.ee/sticktofpl\n🎶 https://www.tiktok.com/@FPLMate\n🎮 https://www.twitch.tv/fpl_mate\n👾 https://discord.gg/rfVSeftbmx\n🏆 Join: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCweDAlFm2LnVcOqaFU4_AGA/join\n️⚽️ FPL Mate league link: https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/kxxssl\n️⚽️ FPL Mate league code: kxxssl\n\n#fpl #fantasypremierleague #premierleague"},"lengthSeconds":"1778","ownerProfileUrl":"http://www.youtube.com/@FPLMate","externalChannelId":"UCweDAlFm2LnVcOqaFU4_AGA","isFamilySafe":true,"availableCountries":["AD","AE","AF","AG","AI","AL","AM","AO","AQ","AR","AS","AT","AU","AW","AX","AZ","BA","BB","BD","BE","BF","BG","BH","BI","BJ","BL","BM","BN","BO","BQ","BR","BS","BT","BV","BW","BY","BZ","CA","CC","CD","CF","CG","CH","CI","CK","CL","CM","CN","CO","CR","CU","CV","CW","CX","CY","CZ","DE","DJ","DK","DM","DO","DZ","EC","EE","EG","EH","ER","ES","ET","FI","FJ","FK","FM","FO","FR","GA","GB","GD","GE","GF","GG","GH","GI","GL","GM","GN","GP","GQ","GR","GS","GT","GU","GW","GY","HK","HM","HN","HR","HT","HU","ID","IE","IL","IM","IN","IO","IQ","IR","IS","IT","JE","JM","JO","JP","KE","KG","KH","KI","KM","KN","KP","KR","KW","KY","KZ","LA","LB","LC","LI","LK","LR","LS","LT","LU","LV","LY","MA","MC","MD","ME","MF","MG","MH","MK","ML","MM","MN","MO","MP","MQ","MR","MS","MT","MU","MV","MW","MX","MY","MZ","NA","NC","NE","NF","NG","NI","NL","NO","NP","NR","NU","NZ","OM","PA","PE","PF","PG","PH","PK","PL","PM","PN","PR","PS","PT","PW","PY","QA","RE","RO","RS","RU","RW","SA","SB","SC","SD","SE","SG","SH","SI","SJ","SK","SL","SM","SN","SO","SR","SS","ST","SV","SX","SY","SZ","TC","TD","TF","TG","TH","TJ","TK","TL","TM","TN","TO","TR","TT","TV","TW","TZ","UA","UG","UM","US","UY","UZ","VA","VC","VE","VG","VI","VN","VU","WF","WS","YE","YT","ZA","ZM","ZW"],"isUnlisted":false,"hasYpcMetadata":false,"viewCount":"60902","category":"Sports","publishDate":"2026-08-17T23:00: