o THE BIG Fantasy Premier League video for GW1, 2026/27!\n\nI asked 100 FPL experts, podcasters, bloggers, writers and YouTubers to send me their gameweek 1 squad drafts. I recorded all of the data from all 100 teams, so I could work out a bunch of information that I could share with you. We have found out who the most popular players are, which formation is the most popular, who is most popular captain, and much more.\n\n0:00 Intro\n0:52 Goalkeepers\n3:59 Defenders\n8:05 Midfielders\n10:54 Forwards\n13:21 Top picks\n14:57 Formations\n15:52 Key decisions\n22:00 Overrated picks\n25:22 Underrated picks\n26:42 GW1 Captains\n\nIf you like what you see, subscribe and become my latest mate!\n\n📧 Business enquiries: dan@fplmate.co.uk\n\n🐦   / fplmate  \n📸   / fplmate  \n🎙️ Podcast: linktr.ee/sticktofpl\n🎶   / fplmate  \n🎮   / fpl_mate  \n👾   / discord  \n🏆 Join:    / @fplmate  \n️⚽️ FPL Mate league link: https://fantasy.premierleague.com/lea...\n️⚽️ FPL Mate league code: kxxssl\n\n#fpl #fantasypremierleague #premierleague","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":38,"length":40,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CIwCEM2rARgBIhMIp7y9nParlgMVD9aVAh2g_AJPSOWfyoyD_sqKlAHKAQQIZ7zi","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rUTNENkpXZV84MVBqcE03SmhNVnNZdXxBR3JiS2FtWk91YzFTYkZRYWZ2bEM5a0luT2t3Q3J4R3oyc2JTc0tzNDJfLUdsSXlQcjcwd285WjAyeGw3SUthLUFfdEV4QVdUbFljQlAyVWVEUnlXQllPR0g5azlNdU5jeXY4\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fgo.fantasyfootballhub.co.uk%2Flanding%2Ffplmate%3Futm_source%3Daffiliate%26utm_medium%3Daffiliates%26utm_campaign%3DFPLMate%26utm_content%3Dyoutube%26via%3DFPLMate\u0026v=lBUr8DGSj-U","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_UNKNOWN","rootVe":83769}},"urlEndpoint":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rUTNENkpXZV84MVBqcE03SmhNVnNZdXxBR3JiS2FtWk91YzFTYkZRYWZ2bEM5a0luT2t3Q3J4R3oyc2JTc0tzNDJfLUdsSXlQcjcwd285WjAyeGw3SUthLUFfdEV4QVdUbFljQlAyVWVEUnlXQll